@@ -3,3 +3,18 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) keeps equipment and bookings in memory.
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` adds a `'board'` or `'sail'`. `dailyPrice` is in integer euro cents.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }` for the period.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item and returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+
+Periods are UTC midnights written as ISO-8601, such as `2026-07-01T00:00:00Z`. `end` is the start of the
+day after the last rented day, so `2026-07-01` to `2026-07-03` is two days. `quote` and `book` throw for
+an unknown item or an invalid period, and `book` also throws when the item is already booked for part of
+the period. Cancellations are not implemented yet.
+
+Run the tests with `npm test`.
